      "3938"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Cleared patches had lower moth richness than unmanaged or closed-canopy areas.",
    "citations": [
      "3938"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Larger clearings supported higher butterfly richness and abundance than undisturbed forest.",
    "citations": [
      "3938"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Wider rides had lower macro-moth abundance than standard-width rides or mature forest.",
    "citations": [
      "3938"
    ]
  },
  {
